      "text": "ValidatePQCStructureDecorator\ncritical、唯一、必须最后、canonical protobuf、长度与 signer 顺序；只接受 SIGN_MODE_DIRECT", "originalText": "ValidatePQCStructureDecorator\ncritical、唯一、必须最后、canonical protobuf、长度与 signer 顺序；只接受 SIGN_MODE_DIRECT",
