      "text": "扣费 + SetPubKey + SigVerificationDecorator\n先验证 Cosmos 经典签名，失败则不消耗 ML-DSA CPU", "originalText": "扣费 + SetPubKey + SigVerificationDecorator\n先验证 Cosmos 经典签名，失败则不消耗 ML-DSA CPU",
