      "text": "VerifyPQCDecorator\n读取 AccountPolicy / active PQCKeyRecord\n按 signer 重建 PQCSignDocV1；扣 gas 后调用 CIRCL ML-DSA-65", "originalText": "VerifyPQCDecorator\n读取 AccountPolicy / active PQCKeyRecord\n按 signer 重建 PQCSignDocV1；扣 gas 后调用 CIRCL ML-DSA-65",
